#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-A expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "A conformant OCCDS dataset carrying NEITHER AVALCA<y>N NOR BASECA<y>N (ASEVN and AEDECOD match neither regex). Since the D-15 rewrite (2026-09-12) the wildcard-free varname() Check EXECUTES per variable and stays silent -> the rule's first true noViolation state; pre-rewrite the WildcardExpander returned NoMatch here and the rule could only report SKIPPED (the no-noViolation carve-out is retired for this family, as it was for PMDA-AD0252/-B/-D by Fix #270)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ASEV    type=Char
col ASEVN   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | MILD | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA | MODERATE | 2
